            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 99,
              "start": 99
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Agency, the Agency characterizes COVID\u201119 as a grave danger that justifies the emergency standard."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "797cd667f062a7e051d50682446c857399f07ff306ae972f72345c0721dc8fab",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-797cd667f062-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court considered whether OSHA\u2019s emergency temporary standard exceeds its authority because the Act addresses only work\u2011related hazards."
      }
    ],
